MMMMM----- Recipe via Meal-Master (tm) v8.05

      Title: Herb Rice Pilaf
 Categories: Side dish, Rice
      Yield: 4 servings

      1 c  Long-grain rice
      2 c  Water
      1 T  Butter
    1/2 t  Salt
      2 T  Chopped parsley
           -or other soft green herbs

MMMMM---------------------------TOPPING-------------------------------
      2 T  Toasted almonds

  Melt the butter in a saucepan, add the rice and stir until it smells
  toasty.

  Add the water and salt, cover and simmer for 18 minutes. Rest for 5
  minutes, fluff, and fold in the parsley and almonds.

MMMMM

MMMMM----- Recipe via Meal-Master (tm) v8.05

      Title: Quick Tomato Salsa
 Categories: Sauces
      Yield: 6 servings

      3    Tomatoes; diced
    1/4 c  Red onion; minced
      1 T  Lime juice
           Salt to taste

  Mix everything in a bowl and let it sit for 10 minutes before serving.

MMMMM
